1
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
[Soft orchestral theme begins over a sunlit meadow]

2
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.500
Morning light spills across the forest. A very large rabbit wakes up.

3
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
He stretches, sniffs a flower — and sneezes the petals apart.

4
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Up in a tree, three small rodents plot mischief. One is chewing on a nut.

5
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:05.000
An acorn sails through the air... and lands square on the rabbit's head.

6
00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:45.000
The butterfly is not so lucky. The rabbit's easy morning turns serious.

7
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:35.000
[Music shifts: playful revenge theme]

8
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:25.000
Traps are set. Rope, log, and clever rabbit engineering.

9
00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:35.000
One by one, the rodents get a taste of their own acorns.

10
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:05.000
The final chase ends with an unexpected act of kindness.

11
00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:36.000
[Theme reprises. Title card: Big Buck Bunny — Blender Foundation, CC-BY]
